<title>USA: Suzuki Dec US vehicle sales fall.</title>
<headline>Suzuki Dec US vehicle sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzuki Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Dec 1-31, 1996     Dec 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		  51		 467	    -89.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	     618		 614	     +0.7</p>
<p> Import Car		 1,025		 686	    +49.4</p>
<p> Import Truck		 742		 750	     -1.1</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Dec 31, 1996 Jan 1-Dec 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     3,379	     4,126	    -18.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  11,476	    13,209	    -13.7</p>
<p> Import Car		 7,009	     4,385	    +58.8</p>
<p> Import Truck	    14,846	    11,031	    +33.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 308 for year to date vs 306 in year ago.</p>
</text>
